    {
      "title": "update notes sep 03",
      "date": "2021-09-03 11:48:26",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4020014099092268017",
      "content": "+ new element: elem_expr\n  evaluates expression at pixel, with pixel specific variables\n+ new automata group: turmite\n+ new brush: bucket\n+ new feature: selection\n  pixel, rect, circle, bucket selection\n  select-all, invert-all, delete, apply-current-brush operators\n  drag & drop selection\n+ new visualization mode: sequence\n  number sequence visualizations, try it out! (try :square, :triangular and :odious with different transform modes)\n  currently there are 6 transformations: :spiral, :array, :vertical-zigzag, :diagonal-zigzag, :hilbert-curve and :z-order-curve\n  can be marked as selection, which then can be applied with current brush\n+ new visualization mode: plot\n  plots with basic presets. (this is for me! i can never remember even the basic sin/cos)\n  this too can be marked as selection, which then can be applied with current brush",
      "key": "1170330::011ca5a4db34f89e770a12e271afa36edffd66b8",
      "tags": null
    },
